{"id":110770,"date":"2025-04-25T08:00:23","date_gmt":"2025-04-25T08:00:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/?post_type=etablissement&#038;p=110770"},"modified":"2025-08-26T18:02:32","modified_gmt":"2025-08-26T18:02:32","slug":"institut-polytechnique-rural-de-formation-et-de-recherche-appliquee-ipr-ifra","status":"publish","type":"etablissement","link":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/etablissement\/institut-polytechnique-rural-de-formation-et-de-recherche-appliquee-ipr-ifra\/","title":{"rendered":"Institut Polytechnique Rural de Formation et de Recherche Appliqu\u00e9e (IPR\/IFRA)"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>L&rsquo;Institut Polytechnique Rural de Formation et de Recherche Appliqu\u00e9e (IPR\/IFRA) est un \u00e9tablissement d&rsquo;enseignement sup\u00e9rieur situ\u00e9 \u00e0 Katibougou, Mali. Il est sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9 dans la formation agricole et rurale, avec pour mission de former des professionnels capables de contribuer au d\u00e9veloppement du secteur agricole et environnemental.<br \/>\nPr\u00e9sentation de l&rsquo;IPR\/IFRA<br \/>\nHistorique : Fond\u00e9 en 1897, l&rsquo;institut a \u00e9volu\u00e9 au fil des d\u00e9cennies pour devenir un centre de formation et de recherche appliqu\u00e9e reconnu.<\/p>\n<p>Missions : Il vise \u00e0 former des techniciens, ing\u00e9nieurs et chercheurs dans les domaines de l&rsquo;agriculture, de l&rsquo;\u00e9levage, des ressources naturelles et du d\u00e9veloppement rural.<\/p>\n<p>Formations :<\/p>\n<p>Dipl\u00f4me Universitaire de Technicien Sup\u00e9rieur (DUTS)<\/p>\n<p>Licence<\/p>\n<p>Cycle Ing\u00e9nieur<\/p>\n<p>Master<\/p>\n<p>Doctorat en partenariat avec des institutions internationales.<\/p>\n<p>Recherche et innovation : L&rsquo;institut dispose de laboratoires sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s et m\u00e8ne des projets de recherche appliqu\u00e9e pour am\u00e9liorer les pratiques agricoles et environnementales.<\/p>\n<p>Partenariats : Il collabore avec des universit\u00e9s et centres de recherche internationaux, renfor\u00e7ant ainsi son impact sur le d\u00e9veloppement agricole en Afrique<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":859,"featured_media":110772,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","format":"standard","back-tax":[],"bourse":[],"domaine":[306,173,161,259,394],"localite":[683],"niveau":[278,347,285],"type-etablissement":[290],"type-de-cours":[340,213],"class_list":{"0":"post-110770","1":"etablissement","2":"type-etablissement","3":"status-publish","4":"format-standard","5":"has-post-thumbnail","7":"domaine-agriculture-sylviculture-et-halieutique-et-sciences-veterinaires","8":"domaine-agronomie","9":"domaine-economie","10":"domaine-elevage","11":"domaine-halieutique","12":"localite-katibougou","13":"niveau-dts","14":"niveau-licence","15":"niveau-master","16":"type-etablissement-etablissement-public","17":"type-de-cours-cours-du-jour","18":"type-de-cours-formation-en-ligne"},"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement\/110770","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/etablissement"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/859"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=110770"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement\/110770\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":126628,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement\/110770\/revisions\/126628"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/110772"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=110770"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"back-tax","embeddable":true,"href":"h